    external developments -- e.g. a datalog foundedness check -- without the heavy
    Graph_Algorithms_Dev dependencies (Verified_SAT_Based_AI_Planning, BFS, Bellman-Ford, ...).\<close>
  theories
    DFS_Skeleton
    DFS_DirCycle
    DFS_Skel_More
    DFS_Skel_More_Refine
